## Context
deploy/user_configs/cidir2r.ollama.toml:33, tracked since 2025-06-17 (29b1ad6) in a public repository, carries an api_base URL for a Huma-Num LLM service whose path segment looks like an access token. Seen during the 2026-11-01 ticket writing; the value is not repeated here.

## Exit criteria
- [x] Token revoked or rotated at the service (or confirmed by Huma-Num not to be a credential): dead, 404 under the token path while the host answers 200 (2026-11-01)
- [ ] URL removed from the tracked file; the template reads it from the untracked deploy env
- [ ] Purged from history in the same filter-repo rewrite as ticket 0001 (expression replacement on that file)
